    <baseline year="2024">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">No updated NBSAP is available. The country has not previously aligned its National Biodiversity Strategy and Action Plan (NBSAP) with the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework (KMGBF).</narrative>
